        "category": "test",
        "title": "Unit test assumes sysfs NUMA node0 exists",
        "explanation": "test_numa_node_cpu_set unwraps numa_node_cpu_set(0), which reads /sys/devices/system/node/node0/cpulist. On kernels without CONFIG_NUMA, or in sandboxes/containers without that sysfs path, the read fails and the test panics. That makes the suite fail on otherwise valid build hosts.",
        "suggestion": "Skip the test when /sys/devices/system/node/node0/cpulist does not exist (return early) instead of unwrapping.",
